    "warnings": [
      "The README materially contradicts the formal effective domain of stable uniformity. Lean quantifies over localization data for which the ideal generated by `T` is open, not data for which `T ∪ {s}` generates the unit ideal. This changes which localization data qualify and makes the explanation of `fjp_1_1_not_isStablyUniform` unreliable. The README should state the actual open-ideal condition, or Lean and its Challenge documentation must be changed if the unit-ideal condition was intended."
    ]
